==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|swëben}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|swebēn}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*swibēną||to move}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*sweyp-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*sweyb-||to twist, turn around}}. Cognate with {{etyl|nl|-}} {{m|nl|zweven||to float}}.

===Verb===
